{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "問答不錄。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "竪拂子，云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "抽拈歡喜袋"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "時作大風水"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "竪拂子云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "佛照禪師有卒菴頌曰：箇中消息憑誰委？一笑掀天只自知。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "問答不錄。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "竪拂子，云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "終"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "更有外集二卷，板留東湖錢堰高路分宅。"}
